{"id":"720deef254f5666fa10748fa05a71e50c46df3db","axis":"silent","repo":"cypress-io/cypress","sha":"720deef254f5666fa10748fa05a71e50c46df3db","parsed":{"files":[{"path":"cli/CHANGELOG.md","lines":["@@ -7,6 +7,7 @@"," "," **Performance:**"," ","+- Cypress starts faster and uses less memory in both `cypress open` and `cypress run`, and takes up less disk space once installed. Fixed in [#35452](https://github.com/cypress-io/cypress/pull/35452)."," - Cypress now uses less memory in `cypress open` and `cypress run`. Each Cypress process now stores the code it preloads at startup more compactly. Fixed in [#35420](https://github.com/cypress-io/cypress/pull/35420)."," - `cypress run --record` on Linux and macOS now starts recording sooner when the processes that launched Cypress have very large environments, as is common in CI. Fixed in [#35372](https://github.com/cypress-io/cypress/pull/35372)."," - When your config file or a plugin throws an error whose stack trace contains a very long line, Cypress now shows the error and its code frame right away. Previously, finding the error's location in such a line could stop Cypress from responding for seconds or minutes. Fixed in [#35368](https://github.com/cypress-io/cypress/pull/35368)."],"additions":1,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"knip.json","lines":["@@ -8,9 +8,7 @@","         \"scripts/after-sign-hook.js\",","         \"scripts/gulp/tasks/gulpGraphql.ts\",","         \"scripts/add-install-comment.js\",","-        \"scripts/semantic-commits/get-binary-release-data.js\",","-        \"scripts/binary/binary-entry-point-source.js\",","-        \"scripts/binary/binary-byte-node-entry-point-source.js\"","+        \"scripts/semantic-commits/get-binary-release-data.js\"","       ],","       \"ignoreDependencies\": [","         \"@electron/fuses\",","@@ -29,7 +27,6 @@","         \"@octokit/auth-app\",","         \"@octokit/core\",","         \"@percy/cli\",","-        \"bytenode\",","         \"chai-as-promised\",","       